{"title":"Leather reinforced mask","sourceTitle":"Leather reinforced mask/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Leather_reinforced_mask\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Leather reinforced mask (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Leather_reinforced_mask/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Кожаная усиленная маска (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Leather_reinforced_mask/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"皮革强化面罩 (20% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div><p>A <b>Máscara reforçada de couro</b> é a única cobertura facial atualmente fabricável por todas as classes.\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Ingredientes necessários:</b>\n</p><p><a href=\"/Barrel\" title=\"Barrel\">Barril</a> + 4 <a href=\"/Black_dye\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Black dye\">Corante preto</a> + 2 <a href=\"/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Couro</a> (Informações detalhadas sobre o método de produção de couro podem ser encontradas aqui: <a href=\"/Leather_Working\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Leather Working\">Trabalho com couro</a>)\n</p><p><br />\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Leather_Reinforced_mask_guide_image.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/0/0d/Leather_Reinforced_mask_guide_image.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"344\" height=\"224\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"344\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-defa